Section 4 Report Summary (Use in Documentation)

You can include a summary such as:

The exploratory data analysis revealed several important patterns.
 Most students were between 15 and 18 years old, and the majority passed the course. 
 Students with more study time generally achieved higher pass rates, while those with a history of previous failures or high absenteeism were more likely to fail. 
 Correlation analysis showed that academic indicators had stronger relationships with the target variable than demographic characteristics. These findings guided the feature selection process for model building.